OL,3,GNEWSA'Extraordinary' Viking items
OL,4,Adeclared as treasure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison Fox, curator of archaeology for
OL,7,FManx National Heritage, said it was
OL,8,F"one of the most significant groups of
OL,9,FViking Age objects found on the Isle of
OL,10,FMan".
